    "4_process_taxonomy": "Manufacturing workflows, value chains, input/output mappings",
    "5_compliance_requirements": "Reporting obligations, audit trails, certification standards",
    "6_commercial_intelligence": "Buying journey per DWS_ROLES_REGISTRY (R01-R25), pain points, wedge entry points",
